{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_rockr_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_rockr_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"六百镑","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rockr_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f230ab4770d203d9528a352f022ea4536e28e6ec8c31c03e04fe482dcd7d313c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"伦蒂尼姆一个落雪的傍晚，罗谢尔正等着父亲带着公司发的六百镑补偿金回家。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪一直下着，不大，但很黏稠。\n没人知道这场雪会下到什么时候。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"拿着，赶紧走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我点了数额就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"总共六百镑，你摆什么谱？再说联合源石工业这么大的集团，还能欠你一个人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我点了数额再走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你爱怎么着怎么着吧，我也不急在这一时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"铁路废线快两年，你是最后一个签补偿金清算合同的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......五八，五九，六十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（长长的叹息声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这事总算是结了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"合同你签好了，钱你也点清了，现在你和公司没关系了。出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我们马上下班，你还磨蹭什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"想什么，钱？多一个便士也没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想公司当年许诺的那些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"电影院，公共浴室，托儿所，车间里的盐汽水。有些实现了，有些没实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但我以前想，已经有的，总不会再变了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你爱想回家想去，赶紧走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"公司向你许诺的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......出去，算我求你，出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"街灯年久失修，一半已经不亮，另一半无力地闪着，反衬得商业区方向的雪夜一片刺眼的橘黄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人充耳不闻，还要往前迈步，但一柄小刀已经抵在他的腰间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"钱拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我没钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你刚得了一笔钱。拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别磨蹭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你是机务段哪个车间的？检修车间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——不对，别他妈跟个领导似的问这问那，钱拿出来，别逼我动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"聊两句行吗？你要是真有过不去的坎，我借你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"借？你当我没借过？现在这光景，谁肯借一个病人钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算你借我，我还得上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可以等你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我数到三，要钱还是要命，你想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一......二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............三！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经数到三了，你别逼我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的肺已经烂了，我这条命不值钱！我真捅得下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把钱拿出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快点！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"见工人毫无反应，劫匪将手中的刀往前送了送，割开了工人的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"捅破什么东西的感觉传到手上，劫匪的刀尖却触电般往后缩了几寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫匪的话尚未说出口，工人从怀中掏出不甚厚实的信封，隔着自己的肩膀递了过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫匪如临大赦，颤抖着手将信封夺过。等到工人转过身时，歇斯底里的劫匪已经连同补偿金消失在了黑夜里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"六百镑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人站了一会儿，慢慢走到马路边，在裤兜里摸了半天，摸出一根烟来，用仅剩的一根火柴点上了。\n他深深吸一口烟，仿佛醉了一样蹲下去。\n一点红光在黑暗中明灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"罗谢尔，我回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"罗谢尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"罗谢尔·洛克威尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"跑哪去了？天黑了，又下着雪，我得找她去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这么晚才回家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听邻居说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说你被......抢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"父亲轻轻点了点头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚到他们说的地方去，那里已经一个人都没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁抢了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他区的劫匪不会到我们这儿来的，一定是轻工业区的人，不会错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至还知道你今天领补偿金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定要让他被抓起来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"罗谢尔，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他稍微说了几句话，他也是没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要是来好好商量，我们怎么可能不借给他？可这是抢劫啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一他狠下心去，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他下不去手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"真下得去手的人，会直接在背后用榔头敲人脑袋，几个月前那人就是那么干的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗谢尔打了个寒噤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他身体实在太糟，现在这种时候，也没人愿意借他钱，他才不得不抢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都是工友，他只是一时糊涂。等到光景好起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的会有那一天吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"会有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了吗？几年前你过生日，机务段的所有人一起给你用边角料造了一架无人机，还能飞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不光机务段，其实整个轻工业区的人都是一家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他一定会还的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，信不过爸爸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是不信，是今天下午，克拉克阿姨来央求我们借一点吃的，他们家揭不开锅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们家有五个孩子的，你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你晚上会带补偿金回来，就把一整条面包......全给他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人相对无言。\n多年前建成的房屋姑且保暖，只有窗缝里透进来的呜呜声提醒他们，窗外的雪越发大了，风也刮了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再去克拉克阿姨家问问，看看他们还有没有吃剩的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的风雪，别跑这一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我明天再去街上转转，看看有没有厂子还要锅炉工。实在不行，我还可以做力工活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗谢尔","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的腰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。哪个工人没点小伤小病？我这已经算好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心我，早点睡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"若干年后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，这里还有一个伤员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了——罗伯逊叔叔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊先生，还能站起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我去拿担架，麻烦你看着他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，您还看到其他受伤的人了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，你先别说话，坚持住，担架马上就来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我算搞明白萨卡兹这次当街打人的原因了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在轻工业区搞了个“工作禁令”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作也能禁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了去他们占领的工厂做工，其余的雇佣关系全都被禁止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不就是把人逼进他们的工厂里，把不愿给他们工作的人活活饿死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人被打，就是因为被萨卡兹发现他们在给非萨卡兹打零工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些家里没人的老弱病残呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得他们会管？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群魔族佬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去照顾那些伤得轻的人吧，我们的药还有，省着点用就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去照顾罗伯逊叔叔，他的情况......不太好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，这是下午的药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能坐起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，该吃药了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，上午的药你也没吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"照顾我......干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是伦蒂尼姆工人中的一员，我们就一定会照顾你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况爸爸跟我说过，我们轻工业区的都是一家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是铁路机务段的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊的手紧紧抓住床单，但洛洛并未看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"换......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换、换人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，换个人照顾你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就去叫其他人来照顾你，但请你一定把药吃了，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（闭上双眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（极轻微地点头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，伤员们怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤都好得差不多了，今天应该都可以回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们一走，我们也就该转移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，刚才罗伯逊一直在敲床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给他端水送饭拿药他都摇头，也不是要上厕所。他病得说不出话，只是一个劲儿地敲床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜他是要你过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我马上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛快步走进帐篷，罗伯逊甚至还在无力地敲着床板。\n直到他睁开眼，看到洛洛的身影，单调的敲击声才停息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，是要我过来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，我来了，我在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻轻拍了拍床）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我......坐在床边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几片木板拼起来的床铺，还没一个壮实些的人宽。\n洛洛怕坐到罗伯逊，用手在床边探了探，却只能摸到坚硬的床板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，我在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你现在已经在按时吃药了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是好事呀。只有这样，你的伤才能好得......"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊的喉咙里发出含混的声响，不成话语，意思却很明确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，我说这些干什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我们聊聊以前的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前爸爸还在的时候，他常跟我说，铁路是轻工业区的血管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原料从铁路源源不断地运进工业区，进入车间和厂房，变成产品，再由铁路运出工业区，进入整个伦蒂尼姆，整个维多利亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商品是血管中流淌的血液，而铁路工人则是组成铁路的......组成铁路的......那个词是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，细胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"细胞亲密无间，齐心协力，血液才能畅通无阻，细胞才能从血液的交换中得到养分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了想，对爸爸说，那么，火车经过时咣当咣当的声音，就是轻工业区的脉搏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喘息声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸想了想，夸我说得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来，火车经过时，我一想到这些话，就觉得火车声不但不吵，反而像自己的心跳声一样，听着听着就能静下心来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咣当，咣当......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛轻轻模仿着火车的声音，罗伯逊安静地听着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再后来，轻工业区的工厂一家接一家地关停，连铁路也废了线......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸气声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我说着说着就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不说伤心事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的无人机，我叫它洛克十一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一的意思是， 从洛克一号开始，它已经是我的第十一代无人机了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是队长用各种东西拼的，比不上商店里卖的，但这里面也有我的想法，它们也帮了我好大的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军成立以来，要不是有这些无人机，我们可能已经被萨卡兹抓住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还得感谢你，感谢爸爸在机务段的同事们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急促的呼吸声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得吗？我小时候过生日，机务段一起给我用各种边角料造了一架无人机，核心引擎还是你做的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢得不行。虽然那架无人机飞不高，但我一有空，就让它悬停在家里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着旋转的机翼，就会想，等我长大了，一定要造出更大、更好的无人机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样爸爸就不用日夜守在锅炉旁边，罗伯逊叔叔也不用总是在检修的时候爬上爬下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家和和睦睦地生活在一起，下班了一起出去，喝两瓶啤酒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含混不清的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊的咳嗽声打断了洛洛的话。\n洛洛在他眼角看到潮湿的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不说这个了！我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊再次尝试说话。他刚发出一点声音，又被剧烈的咳嗽打断了。\n等胸口的痉挛稍微缓解一点，罗伯逊费力地抬起刚刚用来敲床的那只手，在怀中摸索起来。\n摸索了许久，他最终掏出一个小塑料袋，里面是装得满满当当的钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......给我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊叔叔，这是你辛辛苦苦攒下来的钱，我不能收！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍床板）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，罗伯逊叔叔，这钱我真的不能收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，我把钱暂时收起来，等找到你的家人之后再把钱还给他们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊浑浊的眼睛恳切地看着洛洛，但洛洛的坚决让他望而生畏。\n他放弃了。\n他想叹气，但他做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他缓了口气，再次把手伸入怀中，这次掏出来的，是一个污迹斑斑的信封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信封......信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，信我一定带到，只是这个钱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伯逊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力敲击床板）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是这个意思？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛把信封翻了过来，上面草草写着几个陈旧的字，很久以前就已经被汗水洇开：\n洛克威尔，补偿金600镑。\n洛洛瞪大了眼睛。\n然后，她看到，罗伯逊用尽全身的力气，把塑料袋口扯开，花花绿绿的钱撒了一地。\n十镑的，五镑的，一镑的，其间还夹杂着硬币的闪光。\n那绝对不是公司发补偿金时该有的面额，只有一个便士一个便士攒起来的钱才会是这样。\n这就是罗伯逊被萨卡兹打伤最初的，也最根本的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伯逊......叔叔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伯逊没有应声。\n他像个工人一样，耗尽了这一身血肉里蕴藏的所有力气，最后沉默着死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂垂老矣的轻工业区迎来了不知第多少个清晨。\n萨卡兹的工作禁令卓有成效，证据就是天蒙蒙亮就已经往工厂进发的工人们。\n前些日子，萨卡兹们还会派几个人来监视他们。\n但萨卡兹们后来发现，这些人如同一群行尸走肉，上工的路上永远沉默不语，即便没人看着，也从不会越雷池一步。\n为了匀出更多人手对付城里此起彼伏的抵抗，萨卡兹已经不再派人监视他们了。\n贫穷和饥饿就是最尽职的监工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缄默的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缄默的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......无人机？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一架东拼西凑的无人机迎面朝他们飞来。\n飞越第一个工人头顶时，无人机的载货舱打开，几张钞票飞舞着落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"钱？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无人机摇摇晃晃地飞过每个工人的头顶，货舱里的钞票和硬币如同一场奇异而黏稠的雪，均匀地下在每一个工人的头上、身边、脚底。\n这场雪的价值，恰好是一个工作半生的人能领到的补偿金的数额。\n六百镑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"给我搜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"今天上午才从人嘴里榨出这群渣滓的据点，我就不信他们跑得这么快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，一个人都没有，连东西都没了，我们只找到了这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......工业零件的盒子？就这么放在桌上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你，射它一箭，看看有什么鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"听声音像是个空盒子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"打开看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹士兵小心翼翼地打开零件盒的盖子。\n没有炸弹，没有毒药，甚至没有用于示威的匕首。\n里面是一个揉成一团的脏信封。\n头目抓起信封展开，信封里空无一物，背面不知被谁用裁纸刀整整齐齐地裁掉了一块。\n头目还不放心，拿着信封，对着微弱的灯光，翻来覆去地看了一会儿。\n除了污渍，上面只有几点泪痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"narration","text":"若干年后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？这不是你第一次给人钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。我已经记不清自己把多余的钱给过多少人了，反正我拿着也用不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我收下了？谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你这习惯也太奇怪了，到底是怎么养成的？你第一次给人钱是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是在自救军刚成立不久的时候，我救下了爸爸的一个老同事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛抬起头，看着铅灰色的天空，想着这段故事该从何说起。\n她的余光忽然瞟到路边一座刚刚建成的建筑，与四周百废待兴的样子格格不入，楼顶上还竖着一排气派的霓虹灯大字：\n“联合源石工业  伦蒂尼姆工业振兴总部”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
